      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING LIPA (5) could not have been more impressive last start in her a superb 29.67 win at Q Parklands over 520m. Has the ability and looks hard to top. AUSSIE ZIP (4) goes very well this course and distance starting 17 times for seven wins and five minors. Placed last time (30.15) at Q Parklands in a Grade 5, finishing second and beaten a neck. With even luck and a clean start should be thereabouts. SHERIFF (7) missed the frame last time at Q Lakeside but the start prior rocketed around 366m at this track in 19.36. Has the ability and can find winning form again. PADOVA (1) is always hard to beat when he races at this trip.",
